    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuilding feels like such a lie though. like trying to build a house on a site that's already been paved over. the athlete, the person who actually lived... that person is gone. there's no \"new version\" of me, there's just this ghost dragging itself around. if the main character is dead, what's the point of the rest of the book?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
